# Nothing here is used to build the website.
#
# Without this the CLI uploads the Android wrapper and the static export
# alongside the source — tens of megabytes Vercel then ignores, because it
# runs the build itself. On a slow link that upload is what fails, and it
# fails as "Upload aborted" with no clue which file it was on.

# The Capacitor wrapper and everything Gradle leaves behind.
android/

# The static export, produced locally with STATIC_EXPORT=true for the APK.
# The website is built on Vercel from source.
out/

# Local build and tooling output.
.next/
*.apk
*.keystore
coverage/
